<title>USA: Universal Studios names chairman of Spencer Gifts.</title>
<headline>Universal Studios names chairman of Spencer Gifts.</headline>
<dateline>UNIVERSAL CITY, Calif. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Studios Wednesday named John Hacala to the new post of chairman of its Spencer Gifts Inc unit.</p>
<p>Hacala joined Universal Studios in 1985 as president the retail division for Spencer Gifts and was promoted to the position of president and chief executive in 1988. He will remain chief executive.</p>
<p>Universal Studios is a unit of Seagram Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
